/bin/
/dist/
*.test

# web
web/node_modules/
web/dist/

# internal/webui/dist/ ships a committed placeholder index.html so `go build`
# works on a fresh checkout; local `pnpm --dir web build && cp -r web/dist/*
# internal/webui/dist/` overwrites it with the real UI for `go run` — that
# real build output shouldn't get committed (Docker rebuilds it fresh).
internal/webui/dist/*
!internal/webui/dist/index.html

# Local secrets — .env ships with dev-safe placeholders in version control;
# once NEO4J_PASSWORD etc. become real secrets, this keeps edits local.
.env.local
